{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 118, :comments ["<b>You have slipped</b> — from the light binyan, like <i>הכבד סלה כל אבירי</i>. And the meaning: 'You have supported me and I live,' for I have seen that <b>you have slipped</b> the wicked — who in deceit would say that they are merely erring."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:46.581256210Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}